{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Like the striking of…</b> This pericha concerns the exile of Samaria and the witness of the Asherim." "<b>Smote him.</b> That is Assyria." "<b>His slain.</b> These are the Canaanites who were killed when Israel took their land. The meaning is that HaShem did not strike Israel like the blows of those mentioned."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {0 "עד האשרים rendered literally; possibly a textual variant or allusion to idolatrous witness against Samaria."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:24.059772770Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}